Red Agency Ads is the clearest example of how I work. I look beyond customer briefs and pay attention to friction inside the organization. I use product judgment to frame the right problem, then coding agents help me turn the answer into something people can use. That is what AI-native means to me. The product is live at [redagencyads.vercel.app](https://redagencyads.vercel.app/landing), and I am still improving it.
